<title>USA: TABLE-Abbott Laboratories Inc Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Abbott Laboratories Inc Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CHICAGO, Ill. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.68		    $0.60</p>
<p> Net			521,529		  470,423</p>
<p> Revs		   2,900,408		2,699,240</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 772,229		  783,404</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.37		    $1.21</p>
<p> Net		    1,056,355		  950,532</p>
<p> Revs		   5,900,222		5,371,417</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 773,105		  784,547</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Net foreign exchange effects included are $4 million net loss in 1997 Q2; $6.8 million net gain in 1997 6-mos; $3.8 million net loss in 1996 Q2; and $13.2 million net loss in 1996 6-mos.</p>
<p>Total sales for 1997 Q2 were reduced 2.9 percent due to effect of strong dollar.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
